  "notes": "Fixes false charger-detach decisions: a paused charging block with VBUS still present no longer triggers charging-screen shutdown. Invalid or contradictory samples break the detach streak, and valid zero-volt samples still confirm real unplugging. Includes the 0.1.342 guard against automatic off-idle sleep while a USB host or Manufacturing session is active. PlatformIO release build and host reliability/regression tests passed. Published at the owner's request before physical wall-charger/display acceptance; the reported blinking still requires on-device verification. Charging-current settings, voltage protection and explicit shutdown behavior are unchanged by this fix.",
